# jextract argument file: what the Stable ABI added at the 3.15 level, that this
# project uses. Generates com.example.ffm.python.capi.stable315 (task
# jextractStable315) from the 3.15 headers with Py_LIMITED_API=0x030F0000.
#
# Py_IS_TYPE was a static inline function in the headers before 3.15, so older
# libpythons do not export it. Only call it after checking the loaded libpython's
# Py_Version; earlier versions use the fallback in internal.HeaderInlines.

--include-function Py_IS_TYPE
